"""Build the requested A–AR report from recorded evidence, never target numbers."""
import json
from pathlib import Path
from datetime import datetime,timezone
root=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2];ml=root/"artifacts/ml"
def read(name,base=ml):
    return json.loads((base/name).read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
def link(name):return f"[{name}](../artifacts/ml/{name})"
def num(x,d=4):return f"{x:.{d}f}" if x is not None else "UNVERIFIED"
metrics=read("metrics.json");held=metrics["results"]["heldout"];shift=read("shift-metrics.json")["results"]
dataset=read("dataset.json");gpu=read("gpu-futures.json");large=next(b for b in gpu["benchmarks"] if b["batch"]==1024)
allocation=read("futures-benchmark.json");vision=read("vision.json");fusion=read("sensor-fusion.json")
policy=read("policy-metrics.json");ensemble=read("failure-ensemble.json");registry=read("model-registry.json")
rl=read("rl.json");stats=read("statistics.json");formal=read("formal-safety.json");placement=read("resource-placement.json")
external=read("external-eval.json");mapdata=read("real-map.json");onnx=read("onnx.json")
synthesis=read("program-synthesis.json");repair=read("repair-benchmark.json");budget=read("paid-requests.json")
